  ('renter_review_ask', 'renter', '{}'::text[], 'marketing', false, null, 'CarmaCars <hello@carmacars.ca>', 'contact@carmacars.ca', 'How was the {{vehicle_name}}?', 'A quick review takes a minute. We help you write it.', '1 hour after the check-out, 9 am to 9 pm', 'Review requests (migration 0138, app.job_review_requests every 10 minutes): review_ask_after_minutes (60 by default) after the car is checked out (booking status returned or closed). Only from 9 am to 9 pm Toronto time (Program settings). Never while a return or later charge (late, kilometres, fuel, cleaning, smoking, damage, tolls) is not settled or waived, nor with an open incident or dispute: the booking waits on the hold list and is released by itself, or by staff with Send anyway. Not sent when the renter already reviewed (on the site, on Google matched by name, "I already left a review", or marked by staff) or unsubscribed. Staff can also send it from the booking (Ask for a review). Never depends on a rating and offers nothing for a review. Relies on the existing business relationship for consent, so it carries the unsubscribe link and mailing address.', null, null, '[{"name":"booking_number","type":"string"},{"name":"company_address","type":"string","global":true},{"name":"contact_email","type":"string","global":true},{"name":"first_name","type":"string"},{"name":"instagram_url","type":"url","global":true},{"name":"opening_hours","type":"string","global":true},{"name":"pickup_date","type":"string"},{"name":"reply_time","type":"string","global":true},{"name":"return_date","type":"string"},{"name":"review_done_url","type":"url"},{"name":"review_url","type":"url"},{"name":"support_phone","type":"string","global":true},{"name":"tiktok_url","type":"url","global":true},{"name":"unsubscribe_url","type":"url"},{"name":"vehicle_image_url","type":"url"},{"name":"vehicle_name","type":"string"}]'::jsonb, 'templates/renter_review_ask.html', 'templates/renter_review_ask.txt'),
